Usage of an existing AI-Activity setup: the /bx-* slash commands in the order a typical session uses them --- confirm context at session start, a per-TODO work loop, and housekeeping at session end. Fill shows what a command does to files: blue reads into the session, pink writes session knowledge to files, purple does both. Red arrows show which subject each command writes: repo content, repo git, AI-WorkPlan.org, AI-DevStatus.org, or the cross-project AI-Outputs.org. Solid borders are always done; dashed borders are 'perhaps'.
